SUMMARY:Joana Marques: Culpada ou Indecente — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Joana Marques: Culpada ou Indecente\nRuntime: 76 min\nDi
 rector: Elza Cordeiro\, Juampi Cofré\n\nThis one-episode documentary revisi
 ts the legal and media battle between comedian Joana Marques and the duo An
 jos. Through archival footage and testimonials from public figures\, it ref
 lects on the limits of humor\, freedom of expression\, reputation\, and the
  impact of social media. Where does humor end and individual rights begin? 
 Could a joke destroy a career?
