SUMMARY:Tudo é Tempo — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Tudo é Tempo\nRuntime: 85 min\nDirector: Marcos Guttmann
 \nGenre: Documentary\n\nThe film follows four voters from the same polling 
 station in Rio de Janeiro between 2002 and 2022. Over the course of 20 year
 s and three Lula elections\, time transforms their convictions\, affections
 \, choices\, and the very way they view the world.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1768815
END:VEVENT
