SUMMARY:On Horseback — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: On Horseback\nRuntime: 80 min\nDirector: Murat Saraçoğlu
 \nGenre: Drama\n\nEarly one morning\, Mehmet Ali and his son Yakup set out 
 on foot through the countryside. Although Yakup doesn't quite know where th
 ey're going or why\, he tries to keep up with his father and literally foll
 ows in his footsteps. Mehmet Ali himself is rushing toward his goal\, striv
 ing to achieve a result that is vital to him. However\, the people they mee
 t along the way and the events that unfold gradually lead them astray from 
 their intended path.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1768257
END:VEVENT
