SUMMARY:Pockets — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Pockets\nRuntime: 3 min\nDirector: Ilona Vedrashko\nGenr
 e: Drama\n\nJune 21\, 1941. Chisinau\, Moldavian SSR. At a military airfiel
 d\, Captain Afanasy Karmanov speaks with a technician who asks if war will 
 start: he doesn't know what to write to his wife. Karmanov reassures his co
 mrade—no one wants war\, but they are prepared. At dawn the next day\, war 
 becomes a reality. Karmanov enters the battle and shoots down enemy aircraf
 t. "Karmanov" is a film about the final hours of peace and a man who doesn'
 t yet know that in two days he will die in the skies he defended.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1768241
END:VEVENT
