SUMMARY:My Grandmother Puts On Lipstick — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: My Grandmother Puts On Lipstick\nRuntime: 21 min\nDirect
 or: Ulyana Grafova\nGenre: Drama\n\nShe sees spies in every passerby\, and 
 a dangerous drug dealer in her neighbor. He's burying his only friend. She 
 has dementia\, he has a broken heart. They met at a bus stop\, and in one d
 ay they gave each other meaning\, tenderness\, and the desire to live on. A
 head of them lies a carefree retirement\, but their grandchildren have alre
 ady raised the alarm. This story is about how love transcends all ages and 
 diagnoses.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1767534
END:VEVENT
