SUMMARY:Obsession — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Obsession\nRuntime: 9 min\nDirector: Oleg Nikulshin\, Ni
 kita Nikulshin\nGenre: Drama\n\nAfter his onstage fall\, the father continu
 es to focus on rehearsals and raises his daughter through discipline and pa
 ternal love. At the community center\, he pushes the girl through the same 
 routine over and over until she's exhausted: she breaks down\, cries\, and 
 runs away\, but the father finds his gentle side\, brings her back to her w
 ork\, and provides support.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1767527
END:VEVENT
