DESCRIPTION:Movie: Shards\nRuntime: 30 min\nDirector: Arsen Aristakesyan\nG
 enre: Drama\n\nPavel works as a music teacher in a small provincial town. T
 he death of his younger brother in a war zone dramatically changes his life
