SUMMARY:Pitch — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Pitch\nRuntime: 10 min\nDirector: Oskar Tolkachev\nGenre
 : Drama\n\nFifty-year-old director Andrei pitches his dream story to the ge
 neral director of the ITD television channel. Gennady Arkadyevich quickly t
 ires of the director's philosophical outburst and wants to cut the meeting 
 short\, but then Andrei rashly expresses his thoughts on the production sys
 tem. Creative producer Pavel finds a solution: he suggests replacing the le
 ads with Yegor Creed and Valya Karnaval and calculates the project's commer
 cial appeal using his fingers.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1766953
