SUMMARY:Plie — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Plie\nRuntime: 16 min\nDirector: Olga Klyueva\nGenre: Dr
 ama\n\nA young veteran\, along with his mother and younger sister\, is tryi
 ng to build a new life in a new apartment\, but the trauma they experienced
  turns their home into a place of tension and pain. While the family learns
  to live with the changed Grisha\, the music and dance that once united the
 m remain the only way to maintain closeness\, love\, and faith amid the tra
 uma that thousands live with.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1766918
END:VEVENT
