SUMMARY:The Last Parting — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: The Last Parting\nRuntime: 17 min\nDirector: Zhao Bin\nG
 enre: Drama\n\n"We spend our entire lives apart\, like the stars Shen and S
 hang." Orion and Antares rise and set separately\, providing the film's cen
 tral metaphor for lovers separated by space\, memory\, and fate. After the 
 artificial intelligence-created Blue Snow devastates Earth\, pilots He Xi a
 nd Yu Lan carry humanity's last hope to separate planets. Twenty years late
 r\, He Xi finds Yu Lan on the planet Shang\, but their reunion begins to cr
 umble\, forcing him to protect both their love and the future of humanity.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1766908
END:VEVENT
