SUMMARY:Little Calf — In Theatres
DESCRIPTION:Movie: Little Calf\nRuntime: 14 min\nDirector: Alena Styrikovic
 h\nGenre: Drama\n\nFrom a young age\, Katya helped her parents care for the
  cattle. One day\, a cow began to speak to her in a human voice\, and a fri
 endship developed between them. When Katya learned that her father was plan
 ning to slaughter the cow\, she decided to help her escape.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1766898
