 nre: Drama\n\nA family biopic. Set in the post-war years. In the Siberian h
 interland. Frontline soldier Fyodor Fyodorovich brings home a trophy notebo
 ok he captured during the war\, but his son Mitka\, without asking permissi
 on\, takes it to school. Faced with the consequences of his actions\, he mu
 st prove to his father that he understands the value of trust and personal 
 responsibility.
