 : Horror\, Thriller\n\nInspired by true events in the 1920s Yucca Valley\, 
 a miner named Johnny Lang seals his cannibal son behind an iron door. Gener
 ations later\, a motorcycle shop owner named Zach receives a journal\, a le
 tter\, and a gold ring from his estranged father detailing the legend\, lea
